.venv/
__pycache__/
SYSTEM/.cache/

# --- User territory (design-repo model, 2026-08-27) -------------------------
# Anyone using this repo directly keeps their personal content UNTRACKED:
# git ignores everything new under these paths, so `git pull` always works and
# nothing personal can be committed by accident. The framework's shipped
# skeleton files (templates, indexes, generated skill/agent mirrors) were
# added before this rule, so they stay tracked; framework contributors add
# new files here with `git add -f` (see .github/CONTRIBUTING.md).
Knowledge/**
daily/**
attachments/**
